    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Vfriend - Controller Massager</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transform your controller in your personal massager device.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Modes</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SineWave</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SquareWave (Pulses)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i><strong>Music Wave:</strong></i></u><strong> Translates the input of your speaker into a vibraton so you can vive with the music</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Patterns: Regular patterns and beats</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All modes are customizable so you get the experience exactly how you like it</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Vfriend - Controller Massager</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transform your controller in your personal massager device.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Modes</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SineWave</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SquareWave (Pulses)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i><strong>Music Wave:</strong></i></u><strong> Translates the input of your speaker into a vibraton so you can vive with the music</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Patterns: Regular patterns and beats</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All modes are customizable so you get the experience exactly how you like it</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Turn your gaming controller into a personal massager with customizable vibration modes, including SineWave, SquareWave (Pulses), Random, Music Wave (syncs with your speaker), and Patterns. Tailor the experience to your liking for ultimate relaxation.",
